      "prevailing_wage_trigger": "true",
      "layering_notes": "santaclaracounty.gov subdomains (osh, asr, bhsd, news, files) returned HTTP 403 to automated access on 2026-11-07; records were built from the Board of Supervisors IQM2 legislative files (sccgov.iqm2.com), the County Housing Element, Santa Clara County Housing Authority documents, HCD and BOE pages. The Urban County covers the unincorporated area and the small cities (Campbell, Los Altos, Los Altos Hills, Los Gatos, Monte Sereno, Morgan Hill, Saratoga); San Jose, Sunnyvale, Santa Clara, Mountain View, Milpitas, Cupertino, Palo Alto and Gilroy run their own CDBG programs. The County HOME Consortium adds HOME for those members. HOME development money is modest (about $3.3 million in FY 2026-27 including carryover) and is used as a layer under Measure A loans. Federal Davis-Bacon applies to HOME projects of 12 or more assisted units and CDBG projects of 8 or more units; NEPA review required. Funding recommendations PDF: sccgov.iqm2.com/Citizens/FileOpen.aspx?Type=4&ID=269017.",
